  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Make chocolate mixture: Preheat the oven to 180C. Lightly grease a 16cm x 23cm ovenproof dish. Roughly chop half the butter. Put the butter, half the chocolate chips, 30g (¼ cup) cocoa powder and 80ml (⅓ cup) boiling water in a small saucepan over low heat and stir until melted and combined. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/304974/photos/large/make_chocolate_mixture-d6c391376e3f88a29cca42bd939d7223.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine dry ingredients: Combine 100g (⅔ cup) plain flour and 220g (1 cup) caster sugar in a large bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/304975/photos/large/combine_dry_ingredients-0cdf10d8d2a125bf27478e187c42242d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make pudding batter: Beat 2 eggs in a bowl. Add the melted chocolate mixture, fruit mince, beaten eggs and 60ml (¼ cup) milk to the dry ingredients and stir until just combined. Stir in the remaining chocolate chips.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/304976/photos/large/make_pudding_batter-5f199a43bb301ce565b96a4fde6a45e1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pudding: Pour the pudding batter into the prepared dish. Coarsely chop the hazelnuts, then scatter over the pudding. Bake for 25-30 mins until just firm to touch.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/304977/photos/large/bake_pudding-83f7a8affcdfcf99e787fddd0e38f40b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Set aside for 5 mins to cool slightly, then spoon the pudding into bowls and enjoy! Serves 4.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/304978/photos/large/serve_up-689c432be9eab798091e1a18d63c224d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: For even more festive indulgence, serve with vanilla ice cream, whipped cream or thick vanilla custard.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/304979/photos/large/make_it_yours-be2b74d590acf256e342df894aa2fb06.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
